      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the Dust Bowl era, displaced Midwestern farmers migrated to Jovista, adding to the region’s labor pool.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/jovista_california",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Bracero Program brought hundreds of thousands of Mexican workers to Tulare County farms, shaping Jovista’s agricultural workforce.",
